--! The Node platform (`docs/design/boundary.md` §5.2, §8): worker-shaped,
--! plus an exit code.
--!
--! A platform package is an ordinary package that declares itself one in its
--! manifest (`"platform": true`). What that buys is §2's privilege: it may
--! write `foreign`, and it owns `Program` — the opaque type `main` must
--! have. Anyone may publish one; nothing here is special to this repository
--! except that it ships in the box.
--!
--! `Program` is a `foreign type`, so it has no constructors and user code
--! cannot build one. The only way to get a `Program` is to ask this module
--! for one, which is the unforgeable-capability shape of §5: a capability is
--! granted, never fabricated.
--!
--! This is the platform the test suite's second boundary runs against —
--! compile a program, run the emitted JavaScript, assert what it printed —
--! so it is not a nicety, it is what makes codegen testable at all (§8, B2).

import List


--| What `main` is. A program says what to write to standard output and what
--| exit code to leave behind, and the platform does both.
pub foreign type Program


--| A program that writes one line to standard output and exits 0.
--|
--|     main : Program
--|     main =
--|         Node.print "hello"
pub foreign pure print : String -> Program


--| A program that writes each string as its own line and exits 0.
--|
--|     main : Program
--|     main =
--|         Node.printLines [ "one", "two" ]
pub foreign pure printLines : List String -> Program


--| A program that writes one line and exits with the code you give it. A
--| non-zero code is how a command-line program says it failed.
--|
--| The line comes first and the code second, like every other signature in
--| the library (`language.md` §6.7): the line is the subject, so a pipeline
--| ends in one.
--|
--|     main : Program
--|     main =
--|         Node.exitWith "could not read the file" 1
--|
--|     main : Program
--|     main =
--|         formatError err |> Node.exitWith 1
pub foreign pure exitWith : String, Int -> Program


--| A program that writes nothing and exits 0.
pub done : Program
done =
    printLines []
